{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43980","headline":"秋日再寄 · 晁采","name":"秋日再寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珍簟生凉夜漏余，梦中恍惚觉来初。\n魂离不得空成病，面见无由浪寄书。\n窗外江村钟响绝，枕边梧叶雨声疎。\n此时最是思君处，肠断寒猨定不如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"晁采","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}